==History==
2016
*The X-Bow [[Cards|card]] was added with Clash Royale's game launch on 4/1/2016.
*On 2/2/2016, the [[Version History#February 2016 Update (2/2/2016)|February 2016 Update]], decreased the X-Bow's hitpoints by 15% and removed its ability to target air [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]].
*On 9/2/2016, the [[Version History#Chest Rewards & Card Balance (9/2/2016)|Chest Rewards &amp; Card Balance Update]], increased the X-Bow's deployment time to 5 seconds (from 3 seconds).
*On 23/3/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (23/3/2016)|Balance Update]], decreased the X-Bow's range to 12 tiles (from 13 tiles).
*On 3/5/2016, the [[Version History#May 2016 Update (3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]], fixed the "range bug" and decreased the X-Bow's range to 11.5 tiles (from 12 tiles), but its effective range is unchanged.
*On 21/6/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (21/6/2016)|Balance Update]], decreased the X-Bow's deployment time to 4 seconds (from 5 seconds) and increased its hitpoints by 18%.
2017 
*On 16/3/2017, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (16/3/2017)|maintenance break]], decreased the X-Bow's attack time and first attack time interval to 0.25 seconds (from 0.3 seconds). This was done to fix some unexpected behaviour that the X-Bow showed.
*On 11/8/2017, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (11/8/2017)|Balance Update]], decreased the X-Bow's deployment time to 3.5 seconds (from 4 seconds).
2018
*On 20/6/2018, the [[Version History#Summer%202018%20Update%20(20/6/2018)|Summer 2018 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the X-Bow from Barbarian Bowl to Builder's Workshop. It also fixed a bug where the X-Bow would occasionally stop shooting at the edge of its range.
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Epic}} cards start at Level 6 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 8).
2019
*On 4/3/2019, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/3/2019)|Balance Update]], increased the X-Bow's hitpoints by 4%.
2020
*On 9/12/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (9/12/2020)|Balance Update]], increased the X-Bow's damage by 30%, decreased its hitpoints by 4%, increased its attack time and first attack time interval to 0.3 seconds (from 0.25 seconds), and decreased its lifetime to 30 seconds (from 40 seconds).
2021
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the X-Bow from Builder's Workshop to Hog Mountain.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2025
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], decreased the X-Bow's damage by 2.43%.
*On 1/4/2025, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (1/4/2025)|maintenance break]], increased the X-Bow's damage by 7.5%.
*On 1/9/2025, the September 2025 Update, added a card render to the X-Bow's card info screen.
2026

* On 4/8/2026, a Balance Update, increased the X-Bow's hit speed to 0.4 seconds (from 0.3 seconds), increased its damage by 35%, and increased its projectile speed by 14%

