==Trivia==
*The name "''X-Bow''" is a pun on "''Crossbow''", which the device resembles. The letter "X" resembles a cross (十), leading to this abbreviated name.
**In the Spanish, Russian, Chinese, and Finnish language settings of the game, the X-Bow's name translates to "Crossbow". In the Portuguese, Japanese, Korean, Arabic, and Vietnamese language setting of the game, the X-Bow's name translates to "X-Crossbow", "Giant Crossbow", "Large Crossbow", "Bow", and "Bow Tower" respectively.
**The X-Bow 1 of 10 [[cards]] associated with archery, with the others being [[Archers]], [[Arrows]], [[Tower Princess]], [[Princess]], [[Magic Archer]], [[Super Magic Archer]], [[Super Archers]], [[Archer Queen]], and the [[Little Prince]].
**Strangely enough, despite crossbow bolts reaching higher speed than arrows shot from regular bows and thus landing on their target with a higher force which means more damage, the X-Bow does less damage than equal-level Archers, Tower Princess, Princess, and Magic Archer. This is likely for balancing reasons.
*The X-Bow is 1 of 7 [[:Category:Building Cards|buildings]] which first existed in Clash of Clans, the others being [[Cannon]], [[Mortar]], [[Tesla]], [[Goblin Hut]], [[Inferno Tower]], and [[Elixir Collector]]. 
**Similar to its [http://clashofclans.wikia.com/wiki/X-Bow Clash of Clans counterpart] in ground mode, the X-Bow cannot target air troops, but boasts massive range to compensate.
**Unlike the Clash of Clans X-Bow, the Clash Royale iteration cannot be set to target air troops and fires regular crossbow bolts instead of Elixir bolts.
*While not available as a building in Squad Busters, the X-Bow reappears there when spawned by an [https://squad-busters.fandom.com/wiki/X-Bow_Spell X-Bow Spell].
*The X-Bow, along with [[Barbarian Hut]] and [[Elixir Collector]], are the most expensive buildings, costing 6 [[Elixir]].
*The X-Bow's stats are the highest or lowest among all buildings. More specifically:
**Among all buildings that can attack, the X-Bow is tied with Mortar, [[Barbarian Launcher]], and [[Party Hut]] for the longest range of all buildings, with a range of 11.5 tiles.
**The X-Bow is tied with Mortar, Barbarian Launcher, and Party Hut for the longest deployment time of all buildings, with a deployment time of 3.5 seconds.
**Among all buildings that can attack, the X-Bow has the highest attack speed of all buildings, with an attack speed of 0.3 seconds.
**Among all buildings that can attack, the X-Bow has the highest first attack speed of all buildings, with a first attack speed of 0.3 seconds.
**Among all buildings that attack with projectiles, the X-Bow has the highest projectile speed of all buildings, with a projectile speed of 1400.
*Out of all the cards in the game, the X-Bow is the only card to have a [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hyphen hyphen] in its name in English.
*An empty X-Bow can be seen on the [[Trophies|Trophy Road]] as a decoration.
*In the card's description, the "''Would be a shame if this X-Bow whittled it down from this side of the Arena...''" line is from the [https://knowyourmeme.com/memes/it-would-be-a-shame-if-something-happened-to-it old meme] that says "''It would be a shame if something happened to it.''"
*The X-Bow is unavailable in multiple [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|special game modes]]. More specifically:
**It is 1 of 20 cards that is unavailable in [[Mirror]] mode, the others being [[Minions]], Cannon, Mortar, Tesla, Goblin Hut, [[Tombstone]], [[Bomb Tower]], Inferno Tower, Barbarian Hut, [[Furnace]], Elixir Collector, [[Freeze]], [[Clone]], [[Golden Knight]], [[Skeleton King]], Archer Queen, [[Mighty Miner]], Little Prince, and the [[Monk]].
**It is unavailable in [[Global Spell|The Floor is Healing]] sub-[[:Category:Modes|mode]] of the Global Spell game mode, much like other building cards, as well as the [[Cannon Cart]].
*On 1/4/2016, certain Content Creators were given a different version of the game, with an X-Bow that could also target friendly [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] and buildings if they were in range.
*Before the X-Bow's card release, the X-Bow's hitpoints and damage were increased by 11%.

